 which is selecting the right embedding model, text embeddings represent vector representation

3
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:16,960
 of unstructured text and images such as documents, sentences and so on.

4
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:21,420
 So earlier we already discussed, let's say we have PDF document, we create chunks, pass

5
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:27,040
 it through the embedding model and then it creates the output vector embeddings.

6
